'''Ability Damage''' is an [[upgrade]] for [[Abilities]] that increases [[damage]] dealt. Not to be confused with [[Ability Strength]] which is a separate stat.

Ability Damage from Archon Shards do not work on Exalted Weapons, and while Shattering Frost works, it is additive to [[Condition_Overload_(Mechanic)#Sources_of_Condition_Overload-Style_Bonuses|Condition Overload style bonuses]] (e.g., {{M|Galvanized Aptitude}}).

